## 🎯 三、具体实现建议

### 1️⃣ 标注Skill配置文件

```yaml
# expert_annotation_skill.yaml
name: expert_annotation_skill
version: 2.0  # 基于AgentOS重构
description: 专家访谈式标注技能（支持ReAct循环、Hook机制、AgentGym验证）

# 核心配置
core:
  loop_mode: react  # ReAct循环
  max_iterations: 5  # 最大循环次数
  timeout: 300  # 单次标注超时时间（秒）

# Hook配置
hooks:
  pre_annotation:
    - quality_check_hook
    - cross_textbook_consistency_hook
  post_annotation:
    - sync_to_diagnosis_report_hook
    - trigger_agentgym_test_hook

# AgentGym配置
agentgym:
  enabled: true
  auto_test: true  # 标注完成后自动测试
  test_cases:
    - completeness
    - logic_consistency
    - reachability
    - safety
  failure_action: block  # 测试失败则阻止发布

# MCP集成
mcp_integrations:
  - knowledge_base
  - expert_database
  - case_database
  - training_material

# ToolProvider工具
tool_providers:
  - plan
  - delegation
  - batch_annotate
  - knowledge_search

# 评测配置
evaluation:
  dimensions:
    - quality
    - efficiency
    - value
    - performance
  real_time_feedback: true
  auto_report: true
```

